        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Prince, Patty Jenkins\n- Projects: Purple Rain Tour, Purple Rain\n- Organizations: Rock and Roll Hall of Fame\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, recording artist\n\nFacts:\n- Patty Jenkins was born as Patricia Lea Jenkins on July 24, 1971.\n- Patty Jenkins is an American film director and screenwriter.\n- The Purple Rain Tour was the fifth concert tour by American recording artist Prince and The Revolution.\n- The Purple Rain Tour followed the success of Prince's sixth studio album \"Purple Rain\" and his 1984 film \"Purple Rain\".\n- Prince was inducted into the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame in 2004 in his first year of eligibility.",
